            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You know exactly where to strike a foe to target their weak spots. When you make a Strike that you're adding your Intelligence modifier to due to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Devise a Stratagem]{Devising a Stratagem} and miss, you deal half of your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Strategic Strike] damage to the target. This damage type is that of the weapon or unarmed attack you used for the Strike.</p>"
          },
