        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The plans you make include your allies as well as yourself. When you hit a creature with an attack on which you substituted your attack roll due to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Devise a Stratagem]{Devising a Stratagem}, designate one ally. The creature you hit is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] to that ally on the next attack that ally makes against that creature before the start of your next turn.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 2
